(3451916, 482279, 53316, '<td valign="top">Normally I do not care for shots that look as set up as this. But I think you made it look elegant.  Like, it being obviously staged does not distract, as in many other shots, but it adds, because it seems more like you are portraying a emotion or a state of mind rather than a specific situation or event. Hope this makes sense - what I am trying to say is this is awesome!!</td>', 'Normally I do not care for shots that look as set up as this. But I think you made it look elegant.  Like, it being obviously staged does not distract, as in many other shots, but it adds, because it seems more like you are portraying a emotion or a state of mind rather than a specific situation or event. Hope this makes sense - what I am trying to say is this is awesome!!', '2007-03-12 02:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
