(3452670, 482174, 30049, '<td valign="top">Zoom, zoom, zoom.  Sounds like a Mazda car commercial.  :P  Nice job keeping focus on the center of this to get a clean zoom on the numbers.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Zoom, zoom, zoom.  Sounds like a Mazda car commercial.  :P  Nice job keeping focus on the center of this to get a clean zoom on the numbers.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-12 09:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3452679, 482729, 30049, '<td valign="top">The snow and the sky look pink?  I like your title with the theme of this image (empty bench in front of the clock).  The road sign in the back left is distracting.  From the angle you used the clock tower seems to be growing out of the bench.  Did it not work to move left or right to change the composition some?  Just a thought.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The snow and the sky look pink?  I like your title with the theme of this image (empty bench in front of the clock).  The road sign in the back left is distracting.  From the angle you used the clock tower seems to be growing out of the bench.  Did it not work to move left or right to change the composition some?  Just a thought.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-12 10:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3452718, 482618, 30049, '<td valign="top">If you could get more distance from the wall it might work better to eliminate the harsh shadows - lighting is also somewhat harsh on the bottles.  Speaking of bottles, why are you drinking a different brand than what''s in front of you?  :D  Good luck.</td>', 'If you could get more distance from the wall it might work better to eliminate the harsh shadows - lighting is also somewhat harsh on the bottles.  Speaking of bottles, why are you drinking a different brand than what''s in front of you?  :D  Good luck.', '2007-03-12 10:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
