(3452835, 482366, 54044, '<td valign="top">can i just say that now .....you just won the challenge ,verry good image ,i must say i have not made a comment for 8 months in no challenge ,but this is just amazing ,you have my 10</td>', 'can i just say that now .....you just won the challenge ,verry good image ,i must say i have not made a comment for 8 months in no challenge ,but this is just amazing ,you have my 10', '2007-03-12 11:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3452863, 482449, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective used here in capturing this image.  Very good detail and DOF for the distance covered.  One thing slightly distracting, and I don''t know if it was intentional during post-processing, but the whole tower seems to have a diffused halo around all of the edges.  It is a very cool shot and overall a job well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the perspective used here in capturing this image.  Very good detail and DOF for the distance covered.  One thing slightly distracting, and I don''t know if it was intentional during post-processing, but the whole tower seems to have a diffused halo around all of the edges.  It is a very cool shot and overall a job well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-12 11:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3452870, 482628, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea!</td>', 'Nice Idea!', '2007-03-12 11:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3452871, 482608, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice architecture shot.  Composed quite nicely and overall put together (technicals - lighting, exposure, etc...) very well.  It does appear that some detail may have been lost from noise reduction.  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice architecture shot.  Composed quite nicely and overall put together (technicals - lighting, exposure, etc...) very well.  It does appear that some detail may have been lost from noise reduction.  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-12 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
