(3453252, 482281, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very much lke the attention to detail with the chained link fence arrangement. Ironically, in order to achieve that nice fence framing you had to tilt the true horizon - as revealed by building and water background, and the curb where your subject is sitting - clockwise. :( The out-of-focus yellow flowers in the foreground act as a distraction.</td>', 'Very much lke the attention to detail with the chained link fence arrangement. Ironically, in order to achieve that nice fence framing you had to tilt the true horizon - as revealed by building and water background, and the curb where your subject is sitting - clockwise. :( The out-of-focus yellow flowers in the foreground act as a distraction.', '2007-03-12 12:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453258, 482592, 50641, '<td valign="top">Very good.  I was considering a very similar shot. Your background colors are terrific. Looks like maybe a canvas texture applied here? On first glance, it kind of looks like noise.  In a surreal scene like this, you could probably lean pretty heavily on the noise reduction and make it glossy instead, if you wanted to. Anyway, nice going.  I want to believe :)</td>', 'Very good.  I was considering a very similar shot. Your background colors are terrific. Looks like maybe a canvas texture applied here? On first glance, it kind of looks like noise.  In a surreal scene like this, you could probably lean pretty heavily on the noise reduction and make it glossy instead, if you wanted to. Anyway, nice going.  I want to believe :)', '2007-03-12 12:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453264, 482674, 50641, '<td valign="top">Funny :)  Nice props!  Perhaps even more shadow and overall darkness might have made this scarier and more effective.</td>', 'Funny :)  Nice props!  Perhaps even more shadow and overall darkness might have made this scarier and more effective.', '2007-03-12 12:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453268, 482185, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice coloration.  Not sure I''m buying that pose ;-)</td>', 'Nice coloration.  Not sure I''m buying that pose ;-)', '2007-03-12 12:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453272, 482214, 5792, '<td valign="top">A lot of interesting timepieces in this challenge. Yours is one of them. The use of motion blur is particularly nice. The eye is drawn to the paperclip securing the clock''s hands. Unfortunenately it and a few other places in the composition suffer from digital "jaggies" that act as a distraction in this fine composition.</td>', 'A lot of interesting timepieces in this challenge. Yours is one of them. The use of motion blur is particularly nice. The eye is drawn to the paperclip securing the clock''s hands. Unfortunenately it and a few other places in the composition suffer from digital "jaggies" that act as a distraction in this fine composition.', '2007-03-12 12:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453274, 482366, 50641, '<td valign="top">When in doubt, splash water on it!  Haha.  Nice tones.</td>', 'When in doubt, splash water on it!  Haha.  Nice tones.', '2007-03-12 12:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453285, 482425, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed, intersting lighting and nice soft blur. The biggest negative in this image is the severe case of digital "jaggies" on ther edge of the central arm and that acts as a major distraction.</td>', 'Well composed, intersting lighting and nice soft blur. The biggest negative in this image is the severe case of digital "jaggies" on ther edge of the central arm and that acts as a major distraction.', '2007-03-12 12:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453286, 482492, 50641, '<td valign="top">I do love the colors and am not averse to this processing, but taking the brightness down a peg and maybe throwing a warm photo filter on it might soften it for my eyeballs.</td>', 'I do love the colors and am not averse to this processing, but taking the brightness down a peg and maybe throwing a warm photo filter on it might soften it for my eyeballs.', '2007-03-12 12:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453287, 482183, 50641, '<td valign="top">silly :)</td>', 'silly :)', '2007-03-12 12:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453299, 482279, 50641, '<td valign="top">Is that Biteme?  Nice high key.  I like the dialogue between the strokes on the wall and the circles on the chain.  Now for the cross-dressing challenge, put a real prisoner in that get-up :)  Btw - I don''t think you''ll need the key to slip out of those chains ...</td>', 'Is that Biteme?  Nice high key.  I like the dialogue between the strokes on the wall and the circles on the chain.  Now for the cross-dressing challenge, put a real prisoner in that get-up :)  Btw - I don''t think you''ll need the key to slip out of those chains ...', '2007-03-12 12:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453302, 482509, 50641, '<td valign="top">fly''s?  am i missing a joke?</td>', 'fly''s?  am i missing a joke?', '2007-03-12 12:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453307, 482147, 5792, '<td valign="top">Generally well composed and not overly post processed. Nice color and no overexposed or underexposed areas.<br/> <br/>I''m not into borders and usually ignore them in voting, as I did in this case, but I''m wondering why you chose a thicker white border instead of black? In this case white acts as a distraction and your image probably is suffering a negative impact in voting for those who care about such things.</td>', 'Generally well composed and not overly post processed. Nice color and no overexposed or underexposed areas. I''m not into borders and usually ignore them in voting, as I did in this case, but I''m wondering why you chose a thicker white border instead of black? In this case white acts as a distraction and your image probably is suffering a negative impact in voting for those who care about such things.', '2007-03-12 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453311, 482768, 50641, '<td valign="top">Lovely clock.  The bronze and light green go very well together.  Crop is ever so slightly claustrophobic.</td>', 'Lovely clock.  The bronze and light green go very well together.  Crop is ever so slightly claustrophobic.', '2007-03-12 12:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
