(3453320, 482599, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and a refreshing change from all the clock images. ;) Good use of available background detail. Lighting behind your main subject is a little harsh and you overdid noise reduction, which does add interest to the image, but gives the board behind her head a overly digitally grainy appearance.</td>', 'Very well composed and a refreshing change from all the clock images. ;) Good use of available background detail. Lighting behind your main subject is a little harsh and you overdid noise reduction, which does add interest to the image, but gives the board behind her head a overly digitally grainy appearance.', '2007-03-12 12:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453322, 482723, 50641, '<td valign="top">very pretty!</td>', 'very pretty!', '2007-03-12 13:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
