(3453397, 482185, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You took a hard concept to convey in any other way besides some sort of clock and pulled it off magnificently!  This is timeless beauty!  Awesome photo!  9</td>', 'Wow!  You took a hard concept to convey in any other way besides some sort of clock and pulled it off magnificently!  This is timeless beauty!  Awesome photo!  9', '2007-03-12 13:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
