(3458953, 482791, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of a sleeping cat, but the relation to time is pretty thin. Putting the word into the title doesn''t make the picture reflect time.</td>', 'Nice picture of a sleeping cat, but the relation to time is pretty thin. Putting the word into the title doesn''t make the picture reflect time.', '2007-03-14 06:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3458960, 482328, 50034, '<td valign="top">Dude, bleary-eyed on your first day as a teen!  Tie a knot &amp; hang on!  It only gets worse!  :}  Just teasing, but I do think that if you''re into thrills, chills &amp; spills, then the "whitewater rafting experience" down the river of Life is most definitely going to be to your liking!  It''s FUN, but, Boy, what a ride!</td>', 'Dude, bleary-eyed on your first day as a teen!  Tie a knot & hang on!  It only gets worse!  :}  Just teasing, but I do think that if you''re into thrills, chills & spills, then the "whitewater rafting experience" down the river of Life is most definitely going to be to your liking!  It''s FUN, but, Boy, what a ride!', '2007-03-14 06:23:48.000000', NULL, 1);
