(3462013, 482517, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  Unfortunately it''s over compressed leading to a few unwanted artifacts.  Hopefully these won''t hurt your score too much because there''s so much that''s good about it.</td>', 'I love this picture.  Unfortunately it''s over compressed leading to a few unwanted artifacts.  Hopefully these won''t hurt your score too much because there''s so much that''s good about it.', '2007-03-14 19:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
