(3464122, 482511, 40679, '<td valign="top">this is my top pick in the challenge, even when the fact is that this doesn''t say "time" to me. but I guess that''s just me ;)<br/> <br/>beautiful rough editing, with the elegance of the butterfly.<br/> <br/>I do hope these butterflies on the floor weren''t killed for the shot. that would be BAD ;)</td>', 'this is my top pick in the challenge, even when the fact is that this doesn''t say "time" to me. but I guess that''s just me ;) beautiful rough editing, with the elegance of the butterfly. I do hope these butterflies on the floor weren''t killed for the shot. that would be BAD ;)', '2007-03-15 13:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3464159, 482786, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture! Congratulations on a beautiful image! The right wing (image left) and face are nice and sharp. The simplicity of composition is great, with no distractions in the background, and no other bold colors to distract from the wonderful blue of the bird. The space in the direction the bird is facing is good, it balances the image.</td>', 'Awesome capture! Congratulations on a beautiful image! The right wing (image left) and face are nice and sharp. The simplicity of composition is great, with no distractions in the background, and no other bold colors to distract from the wonderful blue of the bird. The space in the direction the bird is facing is good, it balances the image.', '2007-03-15 13:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3464254, 482448, 59234, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is getting at re. the challenge?  Also, problems with lack of focus and composition.</td>', 'Not sure what this is getting at re. the challenge?  Also, problems with lack of focus and composition.', '2007-03-15 13:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
