(3467314, 482723, 65234, '<td valign="top">Excellent; you got a sunset in the picture!  Nice colors.  Could probably crop a tad more off the left and maybe could have avoided the blown reflection if you were a step or two to the left, but then it might have been hard to read the lettering.  Very cool clock, I must say.</td>', 'Excellent; you got a sunset in the picture!  Nice colors.  Could probably crop a tad more off the left and maybe could have avoided the blown reflection if you were a step or two to the left, but then it might have been hard to read the lettering.  Very cool clock, I must say.', '2007-03-16 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
