(3467522, 482511, 70265, '<td valign="top">Love the grunginess of this one. Composition is nice but a little less foreground, or at least less blur in the foreground would''ve made this even better IMHO. Still, an 8!</td>', 'Love the grunginess of this one. Composition is nice but a little less foreground, or at least less blur in the foreground would''ve made this even better IMHO. Still, an 8!', '2007-03-16 22:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
