(3470987, 482214, 64994, '<td valign="top">Well, I have but one thing to say...I hate paper clips...LOL. I didn''t "see" the paper clip till it was too late...I have been around this clock since childhood (it was my Grandfathers and now is my dads) and I guess I had tunnel vision...I see it all the time so...live and...pay more attention!! LOL. Thanks for the comments and considering the score thanks for the votes!!! I have posted a NO CLIP version in my portfolio if you want to check it out...Thanks!!!!</td>', 'Well, I have but one thing to say...I hate paper clips...LOL. I didn''t "see" the paper clip till it was too late...I have been around this clock since childhood (it was my Grandfathers and now is my dads) and I guess I had tunnel vision...I see it all the time so...live and...pay more attention!! LOL. Thanks for the comments and considering the score thanks for the votes!!! I have posted a NO CLIP version in my portfolio if you want to check it out...Thanks!!!!', '2007-03-19 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
