(3473043, 482695, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think there are two things that may have hurt the score. First, it seems a little washed out to me. You might try increasing the contrast, or bump up the gamma just a little. Second, the description of the challenge was "Time keeps on slippin, slippin'', slippin... into the future". I don''t see much here to show the "slipping" or the "future". For the record, I gave it a 7. I like the composition.</td>', 'I think there are two things that may have hurt the score. First, it seems a little washed out to me. You might try increasing the contrast, or bump up the gamma just a little. Second, the description of the challenge was "Time keeps on slippin, slippin'', slippin... into the future". I don''t see much here to show the "slipping" or the "future". For the record, I gave it a 7. I like the composition.', '2007-03-19 14:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3473080, 482172, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this great score. I think the arrow pointing to outer space says something about "future". From a pure photographic standpoint, I really like the composition, and the focus, color, and light on the dial are good. The lighting as a whole seems a little dark for 15:25. I gave it 8.</td>', 'Congratulations on this great score. I think the arrow pointing to outer space says something about "future". From a pure photographic standpoint, I really like the composition, and the focus, color, and light on the dial are good. The lighting as a whole seems a little dark for 15:25. I gave it 8.', '2007-03-19 15:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
